# Up and Down walk one history for every buffer (Textual's default). Up on
# unsent text keeps it, so Down comes back to it; a sent line repeated
# right away is kept once. The field keeps its text across a focus change.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
< :textual!u@h JOIN #d
> MODE #d
! focus #c
! field first|
! return
> PRIVMSG #c first
! field second|
! return
> PRIVMSG #c second
! field second|
! return
> PRIVMSG #c second
! field draft|
! up
? ui input second|
? field second|
! up
? field first|
! up
? field first|
! down
? field |second
! down
? field |draft
! down
? field |
! down
? field |
! focus #d
! up
? field draft|
! field typed in d|
! focus #c
? field typed in d|
? registered textual
